flowchart TB
  accTitle: Adaptive Runbook Intelligence architecture
  accDescr: A local support automation prototype chooses saved steps from an eligible runbook or retrieves context for LLM reasoning. Both paths apply an execution policy before simulated MCP actions. ChromaDB and SQLite persist memory and outcomes.

  UI["Streamlit interface"] --> LOOKUP
  MEMORY[("ChromaDB + SQLite")] -->|Stored memory| LOOKUP

  subgraph routing["Choose an execution path"]
    LOOKUP{"Eligible runbook?"}
    REUSE["Saved runbook steps"]
    REASON["Retrieval + LLM"]
    LOOKUP -->|Yes| REUSE
    LOOKUP -->|No| REASON
  end

  subgraph execution["Policy-controlled prototype execution"]
    POLICY["Execution policy"]
    ACTIONS["Simulated MCP actions"]
    RESULT["Outcome + metrics"]
    POLICY -->|Resolve, partial, or escalate| ACTIONS
    ACTIONS --> RESULT
  end

  REUSE -->|No LLM call| POLICY
  REASON -->|New proposal| POLICY
  POLICY -->|Reuse gate rejected| REASON
  RESULT -.->|Persist updates| MEMORY
